        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> A few things were discussed during Mondays Meeting @ 9:30 PM EST 04/09</P><P>Here is a short summary of what was talked about:</P><P>1.  Officer selection and votes tallied and completed: (3 New Officers)</P><P>Please welcome the following as new officers to our guild</P><P>Chakar	52 Iksar Monk<BR>IInaru    51High Elf Cleric<BR>Gereth  42 Wood Elf Druid</P><P>2.  Raids</P><P>Keep doing what we are doing, Big B is happy witht he work we are doing.</P><P>3.   Recruiting</P><P>There hasn't been that much recruiting going on because of the number of officers available.  With the appointment of new officers hopefully we can get back on track.  </P><P>The How?<BR>Every applicant is prescanned through e-mail which Browso receives/filters and communicates with applicant -- There will be a one week hunting observing period.  At that time observers/officers will make a determination whether or not to accept applicant into guild</P><P>Note:<BR>We have very few low to mid lvl people. There is now a growing number of 40+ folks in our guild.</P><P>Question -- Brought up By Nerual: (Up for recommendations)<BR>How can we prevent people from leaving our guild?</P><P>Analysis:<BR>-- We can't really -- Note: Why do People actually join guilds? (Raids, Raids, Raids?  -- What is LK's purpose.  What can LK provide to it's members?)</P><P>Caution:<BR>-- Size of Guild<BR>We don't want LK to become too BIG else we will lose our cohesiveness and our familiarity with each other.</P><P>LK Guild Raid for every:<BR>-- Question brought up by Browso -- When is everyone most likely to be available<BR>  Using the information gathered in forums - According to calendar, this should be no surprise many are availbe on weekends barrning any real life situation (esp evening EST/afternoon PST)</P><P>4. Meetings<BR>Meeting will be heald at least  once every month on Sat during the afternoon to accomodate PST and European Folks.  A week prior to that a officer meeting will be heald to discuss guild wide topic</P><P>Note:  Hopefully in the next meeting we will have a more focus agenda (an aside from abyn heheh I think there should be a time limit to meetings like 1 hour, so as we can remain focused)</P><P>-- Also brought up by Fizroy -- Need rules of conduct during a meeting</P><P>Abyn<BR>Dominatrix Master of the Elements<BR>-- Should I bring my whip?</P><P>** If I left anything out please add to topic :)</P><P> </font></td>
      </tr>

